# NOTORA — Product Feature Specification
**Tagline:** Capture. Organise. Create.

**Product vision:** Notora is a modern, AI-powered Notes and Personal Productivity app. It combines note-taking, task management, reminders, alarms, calendar intelligence and AI assistance into one seamless mobile experience.

## 1. Notes Management
- Create, edit, delete and duplicate notes.
- Pin and favourite important notes.
- Rich-text editing (bold, italic, underline, headings, lists).
- Checklists and to-do lists.
- Add images, attachments, links and voice recordings.
- Autosave while typing.
- Note history and version recovery.
- Archive notes.
- Customisable note backgrounds and typography.
- Organise notes by creation date, modification date and custom order.

## 2. Organisation
- Create, rename and delete folders.
- Nested folders and subfolders.
- Custom tags and labels.
- Smart folders based on rules.
- Favourites and pinned notes.
- Automatic categorisation using AI.
- Recently opened notes.
- Archived and deleted notes.
- Filter notes by type, date, tag and folder.

## 3. AI Assistant
- Summarise lengthy notes.
- Rewrite, rephrase and improve writing.
- Correct grammar and spelling.
- Expand short notes into detailed content.
- Brainstorm ideas.
- Generate content from prompts.
- Convert paragraphs into bullet points.
- Convert text into checklists and actionable tasks.
- Extract important dates, deadlines and events.
- Extract action items from notes.
- Generate meeting summaries.
- Ask questions about individual notes.
- Ask questions across all saved notes.
- Context-aware AI assistance.
- Suggest relevant tags and folders.
- Generate plans and schedules from rough notes.

## 4. Smart Capture
- Quick note creation from anywhere inside the app.
- Capture thoughts using text, voice or images.
