- Automatically detect tasks and deadlines in written content.
- Recognise dates, times and recurring events.
- Suggest reminders based on note content.
- Automatically extract multiple actions from a single paragraph.
- Convert unstructured thoughts into organised notes.
- Quick capture widget and supported OS shortcuts.

