## 17. Important Product and Technical Requirements

- Build using native OS capabilities wherever necessary.
- Use proper permission handling for notifications, calendars and alarms.
- Never indicate that an alarm, reminder or event was created until the OS or backend confirms success.
- Ensure offline functionality for essential note-taking.
- Make AI actions context-aware and user-controlled.
- Prioritise speed, responsiveness and smooth animations.
- Keep the interface uncluttered despite the extensive feature set.
- Design the architecture to support future features and integrations.

**Overall objective:** Notora should not feel like a conventional notes application. It should be a unified personal workspace where users can capture thoughts, organise information, manage their time and execute everyday tasks with the help of AI.